sequenceDiagram
    participant GS as GameService
    participant P as Current Player
    participant UI as GUI / TUI
    participant G as Game

    GS->>P: askForMove(context)

    alt LocalPlayer
        P->>UI: Enable input
        Note over UI: Wait for user interaction
        UI->>GS: submitMove(move)
    else AIPlayer
        P->>GS: submitMove(calculatedMove)
    else RemotePlayer
        Note over GS: Wait for server event
        UI->>GS: submitMove(serverMove)
    end

    GS->>G: play(move)
    G-->>GS: Updated state
    GS->>GS: Begin next turn